# Dev/build artifacts — must never ship in the app bundle. A packaging egg-info in
# the app root makes the runtime resolve `iparking_lib` as a namespace package and
# breaks `from iparking_lib import compat`. pyproject/venv are dev-only (the runtime
# uses app.json's pythonPackages).
.venv/
*.egg-info/
pyproject.toml
env.json
.env
*.pem
*.key
certs/
